# Fixture: the governed field is on the `number` (IEEE double) lane. The stated
# interval and fold derivations argue truth-preservation from exact arithmetic,
# so nothing on this lane is licensed by a written rule — the arg's declared
# max would otherwise close the WP by interval summation.
field Ratio as number max 1000 default 0.0

event Assign(X as number max 500)
on Assign -> set Ratio = Assign.X
